			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@fedbysandrine\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>fedbysandrine</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@rich_harris\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>rich_harris</span></a></span> well said! I don’t think that portion of the talk disagreed with what you said either</p>",
