			"date": "2023-04-19T22:22:40.260Z",
			"content": "<p>(disclosure: I am firmly pro-build)</p><p>Folks that want to “abolish” build tools are (in my experience) arguing and demanding more from the platform (which I agree with 100%) to go further *without* a build—something that <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@rich_harris\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>rich_harris</span></a></span> has argued in favor of in the web components discussion. This section of the video felt like a mischaracterization to me.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
